OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FA 40-year-old man has been convicted
OL,7,Fof fatally shooting a teenager outside
OL,8,Fa nightclub in northwest London.
OL,10,FAshley Wallace, from Southwark, south
OL,11,FLondon, shot 18-year-old Tyrece Balcha
OL,12,Foutside a club in Wembley in the early
OL,13,Fhours of September 21 last year.
OL,15,FOn Friday, an Old Bailey jury found
OL,16,FWallace guilty of murder and
OL,17,Fpossession of a firearm with intent to
OL,18,Fendanger life.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
