CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786265293
OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FSpeaking after the verdict, Tyrece's
OL,7,Fmother Bonnie said: "Tyrece's life was
OL,8,Fcruelly taken from him eight weeks
OL,9,Fafter he had turned 18 years old.
OL,11,F"He was a loving son, brother and
OL,12,Ffriend with the biggest heart, an
OL,13,Finfectious smile and a personality
OL,14,Fthat drew people towards him.
OL,16,F"Anyone who knew Tyrece knew his
OL,17,Fkindness, warmth and sense of humour.
OL,18,FOur hearts have been shattered."
OL,26,@oD@UOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
