OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FPolice and paramedics were called to
OL,7,Fthe scene of the shooting in South Way
OL,8,Fat around 5.30am on September 21 last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FTyrece was found outside the nightclub
OL,12,Fwith gunshot wounds and was taken to
OL,13,Fhospital, where he died four days
OL,14,Flater.
OL,16,FInvestigating officers later
OL,17,Festablished through CCTV that Tyrece
OL,18,Fhad been involved in an altercation
OL,19,Foutside the nightclub before he was
OL,20,Fpursued and shot.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
