PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786265293
OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FWallace then left the scene in a
OL,7,Fvehicle that was parked nearby. He was
OL,8,Farrested on September 25 ` the day
OL,9,Fthat Tyrece died ` after police linked
OL,10,Fhim to a car in southeast London.
OL,12,FOfficers recovered a revolver hidden
OL,13,Finside the vehicle and forensic
OL,14,Fexperts later found Wallace's DNA on
OL,15,Fthe gun.
OL,17,FA bullet found at the murder scene was
OL,18,Falso matched to the revolver, the
OL,19,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
