PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786265293
OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FWallace, of Shenley Road in Southwark,
OL,7,Fis due for sentence at a later date
OL,8,Fthat has yet to be determined.
OL,10,FTyrece's mother Bonnie added in her
OL,11,Fstatement: "His sisters miss him every
OL,12,Fday and his little brother had only
OL,13,Fjust turned one year old when Tyrece
OL,14,Fdied and will never truly get the
OL,15,Fchance to know him.
OL,17,F"We will make sure that his memory
OL,18,Flives on and that he is always
OL,19,Fremembered for the wonderful person he
OL,20,Fwas, not for the way his life was
OL,21,Ftaken.
OL,26,@sD@LOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
