CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786265293
OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,F"We pray that Tyrece can now rest in
OL,7,Fpeace, knowing that justice has been
OL,8,Fserved. Today's verdict brings a
OL,9,Fmeasure of justice for Tyrece and we
OL,10,Fare grateful Ashley Wallace has been
OL,11,Ffound guilty of his cold and senseless
OL,12,Fmurder.
OL,14,F"While this verdict is important, it
OL,15,Fdoes not bring our son back or ease
OL,16,Fthe pain we have lived with every day
OL,17,Fsince we lost him.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
