OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAt the same trial, two men were found
OL,12,Fnot guilty of murder and a woman was
OL,13,Ffound not guilty of possession of a
OL,14,Ffirearm, possession of a firearm with
OL,15,Fintent to endanger life and perverting
OL,16,Fthe course of justice, according to
OL,17,Fthe Met.
OL,19,FThe jury could not reach a verdict on
OL,20,Fa fourth man.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
