PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786265293
OL,3,CMan guilty of fatally shooting
OL,4,Cteenager outside London nightclub
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Phil Clarke,
OL,7,Fwho led the investigation, said:
OL,8,F"Throughout this investigation and
OL,9,Fsubsequent trial, the victim's family
OL,10,Fhave conducted themselves with
OL,11,Fremarkable dignity and patience.
OL,13,F"We are grateful for their continued
OL,14,Fsupport and co-operation, and we hope
OL,15,Ftoday's verdict provides them with
OL,16,Fsome measure of justice."
